# Anchored to the repo root. Unanchored, these are Python-packaging
# artifacts from the standard template that also match ANY nested
# directory named lib -- which silently swallowed new TypeScript source
# under packages/ui/src/lib and would have done the same to
# apps/web/src/lib and apps/admin/src/client/lib had those not predated
# the rule. Python's own lib/ only ever appears inside a virtualenv,
# and .venv/venv/env/ENV are already ignored wholesale below.
/lib/
/lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

